Modifications for Visual Studio Code: this repository translates the original
Neovim highlight groups and Treesitter captures into VS Code workbench colors,
TextMate token colors, and semantic token colors. The color palette itself is
unchanged from the original work.

The Solarized color palette was designed by Ethan Schoonover
(https://ethanschoonover.com/solarized/) and is used under the MIT License.
